<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 8.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 8.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off price of 98.0 rupees at its five billion rupee weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills, unchanged from the last auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 8.19 percent.</p>
</text>
